    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7467" root="حذم" body-key="H">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُذَامٌ</span></b>  an epithet applied to a slave: so in the
saying, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِشْتَرَى عَبْدًا حُذَامَ المَشْىِ</span> <i>He bought a
slave slow</i> [<i>in gait</i>], <i>lazy,</i> (K, TA,) <i>devoid of
good:</i> so says Khálid Ibn-Jembeh. (TA.)

